---
import { SITE_NAME, CEEC_NOTICE, BRAND_LINK_LABEL, BRAND_LINK_URL, SUPPORTER_TEXT } from '../lib/site';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p><strong>{SITE_NAME}</strong>是非營利公益學習網站，內容供課堂張貼與學生自學使用。</p>
    <p class="notice">{CEEC_NOTICE}</p>
    <p class="notice">宜蘭見聞改寫自政府與典藏公開資料，文末附來源與圖片授權。歷史事實不以模型空想為據。</p>
    <p class="supporter-credit">
      {SUPPORTER_TEXT}
      <span class="supporter-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href={BRAND_LINK_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`${BRAND_LINK_LABEL}（另開新分頁）`}>{BRAND_LINK_LABEL}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
